              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "里 — lǐ — \"inside; in\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "山里有马 shān lǐ yǒu mǎ — There are horses up in the hills."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The new character, in pieces: 里 (lǐ) — 日 with a vertical running down through it, standing on two bars. The next lesson puts it in your hand."
